/*!
    \page dragonmediabackend-index.html
    \title Dragon Media Backend

    \image logo.svg "Dragon Media Backend logo"

    Dragon Media Backend is an audio playback backend for music players.

    \section1 Building with CMake

    Use the \c {find_package()} command to locate the module in the
    \c {DragonMediaBackend} package:

    \code
    find_package(DragonMediaBackend REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(mytarget PRIVATE DragonMediaBackend::DragonMediaBackend)
    \endcode

    \section1 API Reference

    \list
        \li \l{Dragon Media Backend C++ Classes}
        \li \l{Dragon Media Backend QML Types}
    \endlist
*/
